      description: `The Bureau of Statistics has run the numbers four times out of professional disbelief: employment near total, streets calm, citizens reporting something adjacent to contentment. Historians are calling it a golden age. The city of ${(s.cityStats?.population ?? 0).toLocaleString()} souls waits to see what its Commander does with one.`,
