    no_customers: ["The neighborhood moved on. Or the customers did. Or both.", "Foot traffic dried up. The space will become a vape lounge by next month."],
    extortion: ["Three men in identical coats explained the new arrangement. The owner declined.", "Protection fees grew faster than profits. A reasonable person would call it racketeering."],
