    officer_event: ["Personnel update from the Officer Corps. Details in the dossier.", "Officer activity logged. Performance reviews are due next quarter.", "Staff report filed. The officers are doing their jobs. Allegedly.", "Administrative note: officer status change recorded.", "Roster adjustment processed. The reasons given are a polite fiction. The reasons are documented elsewhere.", "Officer transfer logged. The receiving department was not consulted. They rarely are.", "Personnel action filed. HR archives updated. The grapevine updated faster.", "Status change posted. The officer's mess heard about it before the officer did."],
