    expedition_dispatch: ["Expedition team has departed for the wasteland. Pack light, travel fast, come back alive.", "Wasteland expedition launched. GPS tracking enabled. Search and rescue on standby.", "Expedition convoy cleared the outer gate. The wasteland doesn't care about your schedule.", "Team is beyond radio range. Next check-in window in 48 hours. If they check in.", "Convoy rolled past the perimeter checkpoints. The dust closed behind them like a door.", "Outbound manifest signed by the expedition lead. Insurance forms signed by everyone else.", "Departure logged. Family notifications drafted in advance, per standard procedure.", "Wheels up at dawn. The wasteland was already waiting."],
    expedition_return: ["Expedition team has returned. Headcount matches departure roster. That's the good news.", "Wasteland expedition complete. The team brought back salvage. And stories they won't repeat sober.", "Convoy inbound with expedition findings. Quarantine protocols engaged. Standard procedure.", "They're back. Fewer supplies than they left with, more scars, and a crate labeled 'DO NOT OPEN.'", "Convoy decontaminated and debriefed. The debrief is going to take longer than the trip.", "Returnees logged in. Two refused to file paperwork until they had eaten. Granted.", "Expedition closed out. Manifest reconciled. Two items annotated as 'best left in the wasteland.'", "Team rolled in at dusk. The trucks looked older than when they left. So did the team."],
