    rarity: "uncommon",
    author: "Unknown (believed Mutant Collective)",
    content: "A meticulously drawn map of tunnels beneath the city, extending at least twelve levels below the official basement infrastructure. Annotations in a shaky hand:\n\n'Level -4: Safe. Water source (filtered). Colony of 200.'\n'Level -7: Dangerous. Old military bunker. Automated defenses still active.'\n'Level -9: The Whisper Zone. Sound carries wrong here. Do not shout.'\n'Level -12: SEALED. Do not open. They sealed it for a reason.'\n\nThe map includes detailed routes, shelter locations, and supply caches. Several passages are marked with skull symbols and the notation 'No Return.' One section is labeled 'The Cathedral' — a massive cavern that appears to predate the megacity entirely.",
