    title: "MEGACORP BOARD MINUTES — REDACTED",
    category: "faction-intel",
    itemType: "classified-file",
    rarity: "rare",
    author: "MegaCorp Syndicate Board Secretary",
    content: "MINUTES — EMERGENCY SESSION\n\nATTENDEES: [REDACTED], [REDACTED], V. Ashford-Crane (Chair)\n\nAGENDA ITEM 1: The Commander situation.\nAshford-Crane: 'The current administration is proving... resistant to standard incentivization. Previous Commanders were more flexible.'\n[REDACTED]: 'Define flexible.'\nAshford-Crane: 'Purchasable.'\n\nAGENDA ITEM 2: Project Skyline Phase III.\n'Displacement estimates revised upward. 45,000 to 72,000 citizens affected. PR department proposes rebranding displacement as Voluntary Relocation Opportunity.'\n\nAGENDA ITEM 3: [ENTIRE SECTION REDACTED — 14 PAGES]\n\nAGENDA ITEM 4: The water supply.\n'Privatization remains the long-term objective. Current obstacle: the Rust Wardens. Proposed solutions range from negotiation to [REDACTED]. Board votes 4-1 in favor of [REDACTED]. Dissenting vote not recorded at dissenter's request.'",
