    title: "GRAFFITI RUBBING — MAINTENANCE TUNNEL 7G",
    category: "city-history",
    itemType: "graffiti-rubbing",
    rarity: "common",
    author: "Unknown",
    content: "Charcoal rubbing of graffiti found in a sealed maintenance tunnel:\n\n'WE WERE HERE BEFORE THE CITY. WE WILL BE HERE AFTER.'\n— sprayed across a pre-war blast door\n\n'Korr knows. Korr doesn't care.'\n— scratched into concrete at ankle height\n\n'THE WATER TASTES LIKE METAL BECAUSE IT IS METAL. THE FOOD TASTES LIKE NOTHING BECAUSE IT IS NOTHING. THE AIR TASTES LIKE BURNING BECAUSE EVERYTHING IS BURNING.'\n— written in neat block letters spanning an entire wall\n\n'Floor 7 was sealed on day 340. 47 people inside. Nobody came. Nobody comes.'\n— found near a welded-shut doorway\n\n'If you can read this, you're too deep. Go back.'\n— scrawled at a junction. An arrow points further down.",
