    id: "lore_syndicate_oath",
    title: "THE SYNDICATE OATH — INITIATION RITUAL",
    category: "faction-intel",
    itemType: "manifesto",
    rarity: "common",
    author: "Unknown (Sector Syndicates)",
    content: "THE OATH (to be recited upon induction):\n\n'I swear by the underhive and the upper levels,\nBy the credits I will earn and the blood I may spill,\nThat I am Syndicate from this day until my last.\n\nI will not speak of the organization to outsiders.\nI will not cooperate with the Authority under any circumstance.\nI will pay my dues on time and without complaint.\nI will respect the territories of fellow syndicate members.\nI will resolve disputes through the appointed arbiters, not through personal violence.\n(Note: This last clause has a 23% compliance rate.)\n\nIn return, the Syndicate provides:\nProtection from external threats.\nLegal representation (such as it is).\nMedical care (no questions asked).\nA funeral (modest but dignified).\nAnd the knowledge that you are part of something bigger than yourself.\nSomething that the law cannot touch, the corporations cannot buy,\nAnd the city cannot survive without.\n\nWelcome to the family.'",
    flavorText: "Printed on cheap paper. The commitment it represents is considerably more expensive.",
    zoneTypes: ["underhive", "ruins"]
