      rumors: ["A saltworks crew claims the tide uncovered freight containers marked for a city that never existed.", "An inland broker pays extra for intact weather equipment and never explains why.", "Static Forest lights blink in time with ships passing beyond the headland."],
      warnings: ["A coastal berth is exposed from both sea and cliff. Build protection before you build warehouses.", "Every captain offers neutrality until the next storm makes shelter scarce."],
